- I told you all…
- It's crazy!

9
00:01:36,271 --> 00:01:37,771
We didn't come here to…

10
00:01:40,563 --> 00:01:41,563
Taste test?

11
00:01:44,563 --> 00:01:45,480
Raghu?

12
00:01:47,271 --> 00:01:48,146
Bite.

13
00:01:48,563 --> 00:01:49,438
Clearly.

14
00:01:50,105 --> 00:01:51,146
That's clearly <i>maida.</i>

15
