Be right back.
Thank you for your patience, ladies.

40
00:02:45,646 --> 00:02:47,729
<i>Listen to me now</i>

41
00:02:47,730 --> 00:02:49,687
<i>Move with the groove and listen to me</i>

42
00:02:49,688 --> 00:02:51,812
<i>I ain't lying, I speak honestly</i>

43
00:02:51,813 --> 00:02:53,895
<i>There's nobody else quite like us</i>

44
00:02:53,896 --> 00:02:56,312
<i>We Punjabis are built differently</i>

45
00:02:56,313 --> 00:03:00,562
<i>Our style comes packed
With swagger and heat</i>

46
00:03:00,563 --> 00:03:02,604
<i>We dance all night to every beat</i>

47
00:03:02,605 --> 00:03:04,604
<i>Never stop and never feel defeat</i>

48
00:03:04,605 --> 00:03:05,605
- Hello.
<i>- Hi, baby.</i>

49
00:03:06,230 --> 00:03:08,687
Don't be late.
Eight o'clock means eight o'clock.

50
00:03:08,688 --> 00:03:10,687
<i>You picked up the kurta from
the dry cleaner, right?</i>

51
00:03:10,688 --> 00:03:12,563
Yeah, I'm heading there right now.

52
00:03:12,771 --> 00:03:14,313
The dry cleaner closes at six o'clock.

53
00:03:14,563 --> 00:03:16,145
I've got that sorted, baby.

54
00:03:16,146 --> 00:03:17,729
He'll be open until eight.
I'll see you there.

55
00:03:17,730 --> 00:03:20,021
Okay, baby. I'm headed to the salon.

56
00:03:20,313 --> 00:03:21,687
Call me if you need anything, okay?

57
00:03:21,688 --> 00:03:23,646
Why would I need anything?
I'm a…

58
