115
00:10:00,938 --> 00:10:02,563
They seemed like a happy couple.

116
00:10:02,688 --> 00:10:04,313
Adi was a little too happy, apparently.

117
00:10:06,105 --> 00:10:08,895
- He found happiness elsewhere too.
- Come on, dude.

118
00:10:08,896 --> 00:10:10,729
What are you saying?
Think before you speak.

119
00:10:10,730 --> 00:10:12,895
Not another affair, guys.

120
00:10:12,896 --> 00:10:15,021
Ruhi found chats on his phone.

121
00:10:16,605 --> 00:10:19,145
He was planning a "business trip"
with an intern.

122
00:10:19,146 --> 00:10:20,105
To Bangkok!

123
00:10:20,605 --> 00:10:23,562
Oh, man! Why bother getting married
if this is how you're going to be?

124
00:10:23,563 --> 00:10:25,188
- Just stay single and have fun.
- True.

125
00:10:25,313 --> 00:10:29,146
You know, I just didn't expect Adi
to be like this. It's…

126
00:10:30,563 --> 00:10:31,938
What an idiot!

127
00:10:33,396 --> 00:10:35,438
Who would even save chats like these?

128
00:10:37,938 --> 00:10:38,938
Excuse me?

129
00:10:39,771 --> 00:10:43,521
