but for getting caught?

130
00:10:43,855 --> 00:10:44,730
No, baby.

131
00:10:46,438 --> 00:10:49,688
This wasn't some heat-of-the-moment thing.

132
00:10:50,605 --> 00:10:52,355
He obviously planned this.

133
00:10:53,438 --> 00:10:55,855
Such terrible planning!

134
00:10:56,230 --> 00:10:59,355
