No, baby.

157
00:12:42,188 --> 00:12:43,646
I was just joking.

158
00:12:45,813 --> 00:12:47,063
I just meant…

159
00:12:48,896 --> 00:12:52,146
Adi can be so stupid!

160
00:12:53,605 --> 00:12:54,480
WhatsApp!

161
00:12:54,646 --> 00:12:58,020
If his stupidity is what surprises you,
then just say he's stupid!

162
