168
00:13:14,771 --> 00:13:18,521
If something ever happened,
you'd never find out.

169
00:13:19,063 --> 00:13:21,230
Baby, the key word is "if."

170
00:13:21,688 --> 00:13:24,271
You really think that could happen to us?

171
00:13:25,105 --> 00:13:26,229
Are you crazy?

172
00:13:26,230 --> 00:13:28,313
Our relationship is so strong.

173
