You're so sweet, my love.

174
00:13:37,896 --> 00:13:39,646
The booze was definitely dodgy.

175
00:13:44,313 --> 00:13:45,271
WhatsApp!

176
00:13:52,646 --> 00:13:53,646
Ruhi?

177
00:13:57,938 --> 00:14:00,730
Nice guys don't exist, Diya.

178
00:14:03,771 --> 00:14:05,480
If you don't mind me asking…

179
00:14:06,355 --> 00:14:10,396
