or did this come as a surprise?

180
00:14:11,605 --> 00:14:12,730
You've seen us.

181
00:14:15,105 --> 00:14:16,813
Did we ever look unhappy?

182
00:14:18,938 --> 00:14:20,855
We've been together for six years, Diya.

183
00:14:22,563 --> 00:14:24,479
He asked me to marry him.

184
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:25,605
He proposed…

185
00:14:30,313 --> 00:14:31,855
And if he had to cheat,

186
00:14:32,188 --> 00:14:33,646
