He doesn't even flirt.

192
00:14:50,855 --> 00:14:52,063
<i>Is he a cheater?</i>

193
00:14:52,271 --> 00:14:53,855
<i>Is he a cheater?</i>

194
00:14:53,980 --> 00:14:55,563
<i>Is he a cheater?</i>

195
00:14:55,688 --> 00:14:59,855
<i>Cheater, cheater, cheater…</i>

196
00:15:06,855 --> 00:15:07,854
{\an8}Yeah, baby?

197
00:15:07,855 --> 00:15:08,730
{\an8}<i>Baby!</i>

198
