<i>Twinkle Twinkle, dim the lights</i>

208
00:15:49,271 --> 00:15:51,063
<i>Let's do cardio through the night!</i>

209
00:15:52,938 --> 00:15:53,813
Baby?

210
00:15:54,813 --> 00:15:55,730
Baby!

211
00:15:57,230 --> 00:15:59,646
I'm going for a sports massage,
then I'll head to work.

212
