Harder! Harder!

219
00:16:18,355 --> 00:16:19,438
Harder!

220
00:16:21,730 --> 00:16:22,646
Baby…

221
00:16:23,063 --> 00:16:23,980
Baby?

222
00:16:26,105 --> 00:16:27,062
I'm leaving.

223
00:16:27,063 --> 00:16:29,145
That massage therapist
was too hard on me.

224
00:16:29,146 --> 00:16:30,771
It was really bad for me.

225
00:16:31,355 --> 00:16:35,855
Now I have to spend all day on my feet,
working with that French pastry chef.

226
00:16:37,230 --> 00:16:38,230
Bye.

227
00:16:40,646 --> 00:16:41,896
<i>All day on my feet…</i>

228
00:16:42,688 --> 00:16:44,563
<i>I am your lollipop</i>

229
00:16:46,230 --> 00:16:48,855
<i>Baby, I am your lollipop</i>

230
00:16:50,146 --> 00:16:52,105
<i>All day on my feet…</i>

231
00:16:53,938 --> 00:16:56,812
<i>Baby, I am your lollipop</i>

232
00:16:56,813 --> 00:16:58,355
<i>I am your lollipop</i>

233
00:17:11,688 --> 00:17:13,062
You can't scare me like that!

234
00:17:13,063 --> 00:17:15,230
Okay, okay, baby.
Sorry, sorry, sorry.

235
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:19,562
You scared me.

236
00:17:19,563 --> 00:17:20,480
Why aren't you asleep?

237
00:17:25,188 --> 00:17:26,063
What is it?

238
00:17:28,730 --> 00:17:30,021
Why aren't we getting married?

239
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:34,521
Where did that come from?

240
00:17:34,980 --> 00:17:38,520
