married, minus the rituals.

241
00:17:38,521 --> 00:17:40,646
So, why not just do them?

242
00:17:42,146 --> 00:17:43,605
You didn't want to get married either.

243
00:17:45,313 --> 00:17:48,855
You said that wherever we are,
we're in a good place.

244
00:17:50,813 --> 00:17:54,313
It wasn't just me who didn't want
to get married. You didn't either.

245
00:17:56,688 --> 00:17:58,771
What if I've changed my mind?

246
00:18:00,813 --> 00:18:02,355
Then let's get married right away

247
00:18:03,396 --> 00:18:04,896
if that'll make you happy.

248
00:18:08,021 --> 00:18:11,105
But if we're only
doing it to make others happy,

249
