253
00:18:38,063 --> 00:18:43,063
All these pointless questions
just got to me.

254
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:45,480
I need to get away from all of this.

255
00:18:46,646 --> 00:18:47,688
So, let's do that.

256
00:18:49,021 --> 00:18:51,230
We saved a fortune by not getting married.

257
00:18:51,813 --> 00:18:52,979
Let's spend it on a trip.

258
00:18:52,980 --> 00:18:54,646
- Really?
- Yeah, of course.

259
00:18:54,771 --> 00:18:56,480
- You plan it.
- I love you.

260
00:19:05,271 --> 00:19:07,063
<i>This is enough for us!</i>

261
00:19:07,230 --> 00:19:08,188
{\an8}<i>It's written all over you!</i>

